<main class="zd-community">

  <section class="zdc-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="zdc-eyebrow">Community</p>
      <h1>Build the future of intentional technology together.</h1>
      <p>
        Join beta testing, support development, share ideas, and help shape the next
        generation of Ziyu Development products.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdc-filter">
    <button class="is-active">All</button>
    <button>Beta Testing</button>
    <button>Goal Grower</button>
    <button>Supporters</button>
    <button>Builders</button>
    <button>Project Ideas</button>
  </section>

  <section class="zdc-editorial-grid">

    <article class="zdc-feature">
      <div class="zdc-feature__image">
        <img
          src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDy8PqhjFtpri2ZM64Qlf-pkMAANZMhwMV1ntCMqDVRseQPFlWm-ZEvU_mUhHpNQgHYeJ4WgMJ1FSXYSJpKMbK4qiF2SMKQO3ijl7XiMftXBkcTJnQ2_ZnoOffKU5KY3JxI7UBkYmTrRN8LGj9klXDXPO4YWrSUI8ibidnDYfT1rnsHBWKMS7HmOZfeg9mjI6oMx-0GS25nFmWo9zhhAMHehCOAxg0_KFXXWeC6jTTC_lpA9VeBtNz7Tt52RYTklm-9zZI2dDJ6uRNx"
          alt="Community collaboration"
          width="1200"
          height="700"
        >
      </div>

      <div class="zdc-meta">
        <span>Goal Grower</span>
        <time>Now Testing</time>
      </div>

      <h2>Shared Gardens are live.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower’s first community feature is available for testing. Create
        accountability gardens, grow goals together, and help shape future releases.
      </p>
    </article>

    <aside class="zdc-signup">
      <p class="zdc-eyebrow">Beta Community</p>
      <h3>Join the early testing group.</h3>
      <p>
        Get updates, test new features, report bugs, and help decide what Goal Grower
        should become next.
      </p>

      <form>
        <input type="email" placeholder="Email address">
        <button type="submit">Request Beta Access</button>
      </form>
    </aside>

    <article class="zdc-card">
      <img
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNmmfCsH2wkKIic1auKPW9U9px3FVZtc9LKraKWSOVU6ex-77Ra4N9ArmC91U7voWHzjVAR7GWjxbzDldalUW56ATsYZ4IMMOqj_EvmOVbu7vzE8VmLxzawVN4OENpQegKAN2O6SNzBOGbw7nUEutD7cHFn5nrpqVjPq-89J5cHZcgzT-TKogLWfxOaf8hT-ltJ9uxFx0wxkWMfbPaqTU_N8mz2EcNgX5441KZhjkDI1b8jzr1TDZx2xsdVtV6IrvT0-ZtXbyLc2ro"
        alt="Beta testing"
        width="700"
        height="700"
      >
      <div class="zdc-meta">
        <span>Beta Testing</span>
        <time>Open</time>
      </div>
      <h3>Become a Beta Tester</h3>
      <p>Test apps early and help shape the experience before public launch.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdc-card">
      <img
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNmmfCsH2wkKIic1auKPW9U9px3FVZtc9LKraKWSOVU6ex-77Ra4N9ArmC91U7voWHzjVAR7GWjxbzDldalUW56ATsYZ4IMMOqj_EvmOVbu7vzE8VmLxzawVN4OENpQegKAN2O6SNzBOGbw7nUEutD7cHFn5nrpqVjPq-89J5cHZcgzT-TKogLWfxOaf8hT-ltJ9uxFx0wxkWMfbPaqTU_N8mz2EcNgX5441KZhjkDI1b8jzr1TDZx2xsdVtV6IrvT0-ZtXbyLc2ro"
        alt="Support development"
        width="700"
        height="700"
      >
      <div class="zdc-meta">
        <span>Support</span>
        <time>Active</time>
      </div>
      <h3>Support Development</h3>
      <p>Help fund testing, tools, design, hosting, app store costs, and development time.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdc-card">
      <img
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNmmfCsH2wkKIic1auKPW9U9px3FVZtc9LKraKWSOVU6ex-77Ra4N9ArmC91U7voWHzjVAR7GWjxbzDldalUW56ATsYZ4IMMOqj_EvmOVbu7vzE8VmLxzawVN4OENpQegKAN2O6SNzBOGbw7nUEutD7cHFn5nrpqVjPq-89J5cHZcgzT-TKogLWfxOaf8hT-ltJ9uxFx0wxkWMfbPaqTU_N8mz2EcNgX5441KZhjkDI1b8jzr1TDZx2xsdVtV6IrvT0-ZtXbyLc2ro"
        alt="Pitch an idea"
        width="700"
        height="700"
      >
      <div class="zdc-meta">
        <span>Ideas</span>
        <time>Submit</time>
      </div>
      <h3>Pitch an Idea</h3>
      <p>Share an app, website, automation, design, or product idea for Ziyu to build.</p>
    </article>

  </section>

  <section class="zdc-divider">
    <span></span>
  </section>

  <section class="zdc-updates">
    <div class="zdc-updates__intro">
      <img
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNmmfCsH2wkKIic1auKPW9U9px3FVZtc9LKraKWSOVU6ex-77Ra4N9ArmC91U7voWHzjVAR7GWjxbzDldalUW56ATsYZ4IMMOqj_EvmOVbu7vzE8VmLxzawVN4OENpQegKAN2O6SNzBOGbw7nUEutD7cHFn5nrpqVjPq-89J5cHZcgzT-TKogLWfxOaf8hT-ltJ9uxFx0wxkWMfbPaqTU_N8mz2EcNgX5441KZhjkDI1b8jzr1TDZx2xsdVtV6IrvT0-ZtXbyLc2ro"
        alt="Community updates"
        width="700"
        height="500"
      >
      <h2>Community Updates</h2>
      <p>
        Progress notes, beta updates, feature changes, and the real process of building
        Ziyu Development in public.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zdc-update-list">
      <article>
        <div>
          <span>Community #014</span>
          <time>Now</time>
        </div>
        <h3>Shared Gardens released for testing</h3>
        <p>Goal Grower’s accountability garden system is ready for early community feedback.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <div>
          <span>Community #013</span>
          <time>Next</time>
        </div>
        <h3>New goal types in development</h3>
        <p>Testing more flexible tracking for habits, big goals, quantity goals, and deadlines.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <div>
          <span>Community #012</span>
          <time>Soon</time>
        </div>
        <h3>App Store testing preparation</h3>
        <p>Preparing feedback flows, onboarding, bug tracking, and launch-readiness checks.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdc-cta">
    <p class="zdc-eyebrow">Join Early</p>
    <h2>Become part of the beginning.</h2>
    <p>
      Help test Goal Grower, support the mission, or pitch the next project for Ziyu
      Development to create.
    </p>

    <div class="zdc-actions">
      <a href="/pages/beta">Become a Beta Tester</a>
      <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

